Terms</a></li>\n          <li><a href=\"/privacy-policy\">Privacy</a></li>\n        </ul>\n      </div>\n\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"sf-bottom\">\n      <p>&copy; 2026 Snooze by The Sleep Concierge. All rights reserved.</p>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</footer>\n\n</div>\n<script>\n(()=>{'use strict';const root=document.getElementById('camp-vsl-page');if(!root||root.dataset.campReady)return;root.dataset.campReady='true';const track=root.querySelector('[data-camp-captions]');if(track){track.src=URL.createObjectURL(new Blob([\"WEBVTT\\n\\n00:00:00.130 --> 00:00:01.750\\nevery morning at seven a.m.,\\n\\n00:00:01.750 --> 00:00:03.510\\nyou'll get a post from me saying,\\n\\n00:00:03.510 --> 00:00:06.070\\ncould we please have your 24-hour sleep logs?\\n\\n00:00:06.850 --> 00:00:08.790\\nBec and I will then go through all of them\\n\\n00:00:08.790 --> 00:00:11.470\\nwith a fine-toothed comb and write back to you\\n\\n00:00:11.470 --> 00:00:14.270\\nwith any notes, suggestions, tweaks, cheerleading,\\n\\n00:00:14.750 --> 00:00:17.310\\na lot of exclamation marks of woo-hoo,\\n\\n00:00:17.590 --> 00:00:18.510\\nlook at that night feed.\\n\\n00:00:19.750 --> 00:00:21.670\\nAll of that, we will put that in there\\n\\n00:00:21.670 --> 00:00:23.030\\nand then we meet at 10 a.m.\\n\\n00:00:23.530 --> 00:00:25.310\\nThen we have our 10 a.m. roll call,\\n\\n00:00:25.510 --> 00:00:26.590\\nwhere we chat to all of you,\\n\\n00:00:26.670 --> 00:00:28.410\\nwe work through one family at a time.\\n\"],{type:'text/vtt'}));}let step=1;const form=root.querySelector('#fit-form'),error=root.querySelector('#fit-error'),age=root.querySelector('#fit-age'),support=root.querySelector('#fit-support'),back=root.querySelector('#fit-back'),result=root.querySelector('#fit-result'),label=root.querySelector('#step-label');\nfunction showStep(n){step=n;age.hidden=n!==1;support.hidden=n!==2;back.hidden=n!==2;error.hidden=true;label.textContent='Question '+n+' of 2';root.querySelectorAll('.progress i').forEach((el,i)=>el.classList.toggle('current',i<n));root.querySelector('#fit-next').innerHTML=n===1?'Continue <span aria-hidden=\"true\">\u2192</span>':'See my next step <span aria-hidden=\"true\">\u2192</span>';}\nform.addEventListener('change',()=>{error.hidden=true});back.addEventListener('click',()=>{showStep(1);age.querySelector('input:checked, input').focus()});\nform.addEventListener('submit',event=>{event.preventDefault();const data=new FormData(form);const value=data.get(step===1?'age':'support');if(!value){error.hidden=false;(step===1?age:support).querySelector('input').focus();return;}if(step===1&&value!=='under6'&&value!=='unsure'){showStep(2);support.querySelector('input').focus();return;}\nlet title,copy,href,cta;if(data.get('age')==='under6'){title='Start with support for your baby\u2019s age.';copy='Camp starts from six months. Explore Snooze support now, or ask us about a future Camp.';href='https://www.joinsnooze.com';cta='Explore Snooze support';}else if(data.get('age')==='unsure'||data.get('support')==='question'){title='Let\u2019s talk it through.';copy='Email the Camp team with your question before choosing a date. This check does not confirm suitability or reserve a place.';href='mailto:camp@joinsnooze.com?subject=Question%20about%20Camp%20Snooze';cta='Email the Camp team';}else{title='Take a closer look at Camp.';copy='See the available dates, current pricing and booking terms. Your place is confirmed through the booking process.';href='https://www.joinsnooze.com/camp-snooze-sleep-coaching#pricing-section';cta='See Camp dates and pricing';}\nresult.replaceChildren();const h=document.createElement('h3');h.textContent=title;const p=document.createElement('p');p.textContent=copy;const a=document.createElement('a');a.className='btn';a.href=href;a.textContent=cta;const restart=document.createElement('button');restart.type='button';restart.className='text-button';restart.textContent='Start again';restart.onclick=()=>{form.reset();form.hidden=false;result.hidden=true;showStep(1);age.querySelector('input').focus()};result.append(h,p,a,restart);form.hidden=true;result.hidden=false;label.textContent='Your next step';result.focus();});\n// Adapt canonical footer links for standalone review without changing its source markup.\nroot.querySelectorAll('.snooze-footer-clean a[href^=\"/\"]').forEach(a=>{a.href=new URL(a.getAttribute('href'),'https://www.joinsnooze.com').href});\nroot.querySelector('.sf-logo a')?.setAttribute('aria-label','Snooze home');\nroot.querySelectorAll('.sf-heading').forEach(h=>h.setAttribute('aria-level','3'));\n// Answers remain in memory only. No lead submission, storage or analytics payload.\n})();\n</script>\n\n",
